{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05只有18秒，Y却堆了多组感受词，容易来不及扫；S13的“可就算听到了……”也把X中“谁也没法答应永远”的核心顾虑表达得不够准确。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语拆分和关键词加亮，让我不必逐字读完就能抓住每段发生了什么，感受文字的小字层级和按音乐时点出现，也让我更容易边听边接收。反复出现的水、船、摇荡、靠岸等意象，加上更细的音乐与身体感受，使前后情绪有连续性，体验也更具体。X的因果叙述其实更稳、更准确，尤其是S13，但整体而言，Y更像一段与音乐同步展开的完整体验，而不只是故事旁边附上一组感受词。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "57875624-4abf-45eb-a959-989e9288b41f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164159715777Z", "elapsed_seconds": 156.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:44:36.146738+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cadd36d2e6756a0042be9e888015e5765cf43bcac4cd770b2e9f88c8a7d52228", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt